    "<h2 style=\"margin-top:16px\">四路各自问到什么</h2>\n      <table><tr><th>自报口径</th><th>问的情况</th><th>收到几条</th><th>几个地址答的</th></tr>{0}</table>": "<h2 style=\"margin-top:16px\">What Each of the Four Self-Report Channels Got</h2>\n      <table><tr><th>Self-report channel</th><th>How it was asked</th><th>Replies received</th><th>Answered by</th></tr>{0}</table>",
    "<h2 style=\"margin-top:16px\">它报的取流地址</h2>\n        <table>{0}</table>": "<h2 style=\"margin-top:16px\">The Pull URLs It Reported</h2>\n        <table>{0}</table>",
    "<h2 style=\"margin-top:16px\">它报的码流</h2>\n        <div class=\"empty\">媒体服务答得清清楚楚：这台上一条码流都没配。几路流、什么规格，都得先在设备那侧把码流配出来。</div>": "<h2 style=\"margin-top:16px\">The streams it reports</h2>\n        <div class=\"empty\">The media service answered clearly: no stream is configured on this device. How many streams and at what spec all have to be configured on the device side first.</div>",
    "<h2 style=\"margin-top:16px\">它报的码流</h2><table>{0}</table>": "<h2 style=\"margin-top:16px\">The Streams It Reports</h2><table>{0}</table>",
    "<h2 style=\"margin-top:16px\">它是谁</h2>\n        <table>\n          {0}\n          {1}\n          {2}\n          {3}\n        </table>": "<h2 style=\"margin-top:16px\">Who It Is</h2>\n        <table>\n          {0}\n          {1}\n          {2}\n          {3}\n        </table>",
