    "<p class=\"bad\" style=\"margin:6px 0 0\">关口没回音就收了账：文件末尾可能还差几包，别按「这就是全部」用。</p>": "<p class=\"bad\" style=\"margin:6px 0 0\">The books closed with no reply from the far end: the end of the file may still be missing a few packets — don't treat it as the whole thing.</p>",
    "<p class=\"bad\" style=\"margin:6px 0 0\">这一路是<strong>到了文件大小上限</strong>停的：后面的包没进来，别说成「这条链路没流量」。</p>": "<p class=\"bad\" style=\"margin:6px 0 0\">This run stopped because it <strong>hit the file size limit</strong>: the later packets never came in, so do not call it “no traffic on this link”.</p>",
    "<p class=\"bad\" style=\"margin:6px 0 0\">那一路写文件出过错：{0}（文件可能不完整）</p>": "<p class=\"bad\" style=\"margin:6px 0 0\">That run hit a file write error: {0} (the file may be incomplete)</p>",
    "<p class=\"dim\" style=\"margin-top:10px\">「没信号」的那些<b>不是</b>「不在线」的证据 ——\n        它们只是没在这轮里吭声。要确认某一台，去「ping 与端口」那一页单独 ping 它。</p>": "<p class=\"dim\" style=\"margin-top:10px\">The ones marked \"no signal\" are <b>not</b> evidence of \"offline\" —\n        they simply did not speak up in this round. To confirm one of them, ping it on its own on the \"Ping & ports\" page.</p>",
    "<p class=\"dim\" style=\"margin-top:10px\">跳过：{0}</p>": "<p class=\"dim\" style=\"margin-top:10px\">Skipped: {0}</p>",
    "<p class=\"dim\" style=\"margin-top:14px\">扫了 {0} 个端口，逐端口的明细就不列了\n            —— 一整屏「关着」里没有一条是信息，反而会把真开着的几个埋掉。开着的端口已经在上面列出来了，\n            要看某几个的明细，把端口填窄一点再扫一次。</p>": "<p class=\"dim\" style=\"margin-top:14px\">Scanned {0} ports; the per-port detail is not listed\n            — a screenful of \"closed\" carries no information and would only bury the few that really are open. The open ports are already listed above,\n            to see detail on particular ones, narrow the port list and scan again.</p>",
    "<p class=\"dim\" style=\"margin:0 0 10px\">\n        为了让「没有 IPv4」这个结论站得住，先把这些网段主动问过一遍：\n        <code>{0}</code>（ARP 只是缓存，光靠它会把活设备读成没配网）</p>": "<p class=\"dim\" style=\"margin:0 0 10px\">\n        To make the \"no IPv4\" conclusion stand, these subnets were asked directly first:\n        <code>{0}</code> (ARP is only a cache — on its own it reads a live device as unconfigured)</p>",
    "<p class=\"dim\" style=\"margin:0 0 10px\">跳过了：{0}</p>": "<p class=\"dim\" style=\"margin:0 0 10px\">Skipped: {0}</p>",
    "<p class=\"dim\" style=\"margin:0 0 10px\">这几个地址是本机自己的，没有列进清单：\n        <code>{0}</code>（问自己必然有回执，列出来只会多一行莫名其妙的设备）</p>": "<p class=\"dim\" style=\"margin:0 0 10px\">These addresses belong to this machine itself and were not listed:\n        <code>{0}</code> (asking yourself always gets a reply; listing them only adds a puzzling device row)</p>",
