    "<p class=\"hint\" style=\"color:var(--gold)\">这台机器的系统还没探过 —— 先去「远程设备与审计」那页点一次「探测」。不知道系统就把分系统的条判成「问不出」，那是猜的。</p>": "<p class=\"hint\" style=\"color:var(--gold)\">This machine's OS hasn't been probed yet — go to the Remote devices & audit page and press Probe once first. Not knowing the OS would turn the per-OS checks into \"can't tell\", and that is a guess.</p>",
    "<p class=\"hint\" style=\"color:var(--gold)\">这张码<strong>已经被扫过了</strong> —— ": "<p class=\"hint\" style=\"color:var(--gold)\">This code <strong>has already been scanned</strong> — ",
