    "<table style=\"margin-top:14px\"><tr><th>地址</th><th>它是谁</th><th>它是什么</th>\n        <th>管理地址（它自己给的）</th><th>MAC</th><th>谁说的</th><th>哪块网卡</th></tr>{0}</table>\n        <p class=\"dim\" style=\"margin-top:10px\">管理地址这一栏是<b>设备自己写的</b>，所以不做成链接：\n          抄下来自己核对一眼再打开。「谁说的」那几路里，NetBIOS 是唯一给得出 MAC 的，\n          空着就是那台不理 NetBIOS（不是它没 MAC）。</p>": "<table style=\"margin-top:14px\"><tr><th>Address</th><th>Who it is</th><th>What it is</th>\n        <th>Management address (as it states itself)</th><th>MAC</th><th>Who said it</th><th>Which adapter</th></tr>{0}</table>\n        <p class=\"dim\" style=\"margin-top:10px\">The management address column is <b>written by the device itself</b>, so it is not made into a link:\n          copy it down and check it with your own eyes before opening it. Of the sources in \"Who said it\", NetBIOS is the only one that yields a MAC,\n          blank means that machine ignores NetBIOS (not that it has no MAC).</p>",
