    "IPv4 和 IPv6 都能出外网。": "Both IPv4 and IPv6 reach the internet.",
    "IPv4 正常，但 IPv6 有地址/路由却出不了外网。应用优先走 IPv6，所以每次连接先卡一下再回落到 IPv4 —— 这就是「网很慢」的真身。": "IPv4 is fine, but IPv6 has an address/route yet can't reach the internet. Apps prefer IPv6, so every connection stalls once before falling back to IPv4 — that is what \"the network is slow\" really is.",
    "IPv6 出不了外网": "IPv6 can't reach the Internet",
