    "IPv6 段": "IPv6 segment",
    "Linux 上多半是策略路由（每块网卡各自一张表，主表那条不算数）。": "On Linux this is usually policy routing (each adapter keeps its own table; the entry in the main table does not count).",
    "MTU": "MTU",
    "NAS、打印机、Mac、AirPlay 与投屏": "NAS, printers, Mac, AirPlay and screen casting",
    "NAT 没做、ACL 只放行了内网、或者认证门户还没过。★ 这一档不该去查终端设备。": "NAT isn't done, the ACL only allows the internal net, or the captive portal isn't passed yet. ★ This case shouldn't go inspect end devices.",
    "NetKit 改过什么": "What NetKit Changed",
    "ONVIF 常见在 80，也有 8899 / 2020 / 8080；先进设备网页后台确认 ONVIF 开关是开着的。": "ONVIF is usually on 80, sometimes 8899 / 2020 / 8080; first confirm in the device's web backend that the ONVIF switch is on.",
    "ONVIF 那一问连都连不出去": "The ONVIF question couldn't connect at all",
    "OPTIONS 回了 {0} 毫秒": "OPTIONS replied in {0} ms",
    "OPTIONS 它答了，某一问它不答": "It answers OPTIONS but not one specific request",
    "OPTIONS 答了。★ 这只回答「它在、它说 SIP」，设备自述与通道表这次没问 —— ": "OPTIONS answered. ★ This only says “it is there and it speaks SIP”; the device self-report and the channel table were not asked this time — ",
    "PoE 余量紧了": "PoE headroom is tight",
    "PoE 表没读全，下不了结论": "PoE table not fully read, can't conclude",
    "PrevTagSize 对不上的标签 {0} 个（这一项常见的平台上很多，不改判定）": "{0} tags whose PrevTagSize doesn't line up (very common on many streaming servers; doesn't change the verdict)",
    "RTMP 的凭据有三种挂法：流名后面那段 ?key=、应用名那一段、或者 connect 参数里的 vhost。": "RTMP credentials attach three ways: the ?key= part after the stream name, the application-name segment, or the vhost in the connect parameters.",
    "RTMP 的凭据有三种落点：挂在流名后面的 ?key=、挂在应用名上、或者进 connect 参数里的 vhost。": "RTMP credentials have three possible homes: a ?key= after the stream name, on the application name, or in the vhost of the connect arguments.",
    "SERVFAIL 是它那一侧的账（它的上游或转发坏了），改本机没用的方向。": "SERVFAIL is on its side (its upstream or forwarding is broken); changing this machine is the wrong direction.",
    "SERVFAIL 是服务器那一边的问题（它的上游或转发坏了），换一台服务器大概率就能出结果。": "SERVFAIL is the server's own problem (its upstream or forwarding is broken); switching to another server will most likely give a result.",
    "SNMP 通，团体名可用": "SNMP reachable, community string works",
    "TCP 交织": "TCP interleaving",
    "TCP 收得到就是那批 UDP 口被挡，不是设备没发。": "If TCP is received, those UDP ports are blocked - the device is transmitting.",
    "TCP 是建起来了，问一句清单过去半天不回。★ 平台的清单接口挂住了：": "TCP did come up, but a request for the playlist has not been answered for ages. ★ The streaming server's playlist interface is stuck:",
    "TCP 走到哪一步": "How far the TCP got",
    "TCP 那一路要能收到，就是那批 UDP 口被挡了，不是设备没发。": "If the TCP path receives, those UDP ports are blocked, not the device failing to send.",
    "TFTP 那一侧": "The TFTP side",
    "TLS 1.0 / 1.1 已被新版浏览器和平台直接拒绝连接。★ 要升级的是设备侧的 TLS 栈，": "TLS 1.0 / 1.1 is refused outright by current browsers and streaming servers. ★ What has to be upgraded is the TLS stack on the device side,",
    "TLS 1.0/1.1 已被新版浏览器和平台直接拒绝连接。要升级设备侧的 TLS 栈，换证书解决不了。": "TLS 1.0/1.1 is refused outright by current browsers and platforms. The device's TLS stack needs upgrading — swapping the certificate won't fix it.",
    "TLS 握手被对方拒了": "TLS handshake refused by the peer",
    "TLS 没谈成": "TLS handshake failed",
    "UDP 整段静默": "Whole UDP range silent",
