    "USB 网卡": "USB network adapter",
    "\\u 转义": "\\u escapes",
    "admin 是 testing（设备在做线测），这一趟的状态不代表正常转发时的状态。": "admin reads testing (the device is doing cable testing), so this run's state does not represent normal forwarding.",
    "admin 是开着的 —— 这不是有人关的：多半它本来就不是 PoE 口，或者电源池不够、设备把它排除了。": "admin is on — nobody switched it off: most likely it was never a PoE port, or the power budget was short and the device excluded it.",
    "admin 本身就是 down —— 有人在设备上 shutdown 了它，不是链路故障，照着「查线」去跑一趟是白跑。": "admin itself is down — someone shut it down on the device. This isn't a link fault, so a \"check the cable\" run is wasted.",
    "adminEnable=false —— 有人在设备上把这个口的 PoE 关掉了，不是故障，照着「查线」跑一趟是白跑。": "adminEnable=false - someone switched off PoE on this port at the device; it's not a fault, and running the cable check is a wasted trip.",
    "connect 后面就断 —— 这台的白名单 / 频次限制把这一问踢了；什么都没收到就断 —— 中间那台设备在掐。": "After connect it drops — this device's whitelist / rate limit kicked this query out; it drops before anything comes back — a device in the middle is cutting it.",
    "connect 后面就断 —— 这台的白名单或频次限制把这一问踢了；什么都没收到就断 —— 中间那台在掐。": "Dropped right after connect — this device's whitelist or rate limit rejected the check; dropped with nothing received — something in the middle is cutting it.",
    "connect 回的是 {0}{1}": "connect returned {0}{1}",
    "connect 被拒": "connect refused",
    "connect 被拒 —— 应用名不对，或这台只肯收推流": "connect refused — wrong application name, or this server only accepts stream ingest",
    "filtered 是它一句都不答（只放行白名单 —— 相机与平台之间最常卡这一条）。": "filtered means it never answers at all (only the allow-list gets through — this is what camera-to-server links most often hang on).",
    "filtered 是它一句都不答（防火墙只放行了白名单）。这两种下一步完全不同，别并成「网络不通」。": "filtered means it never answers at all (the firewall only lets the allow-list through). The next step is completely different for the two; do not merge them into “the network is down”.",
    "filtered 是它一句都不答（防火墙只放行了白名单，相机与平台之间最常卡这一条）。": "filtered means it answers not a single word (the firewall only allows the whitelist — the most common stall between camera and platform).",
    "filtered 是它一句都不答（防火墙只放行白名单 —— 相机与平台之间最常卡这一条）。": "filtered means it won't answer a single word (the firewall only lets a whitelist through — the most common thing stuck between a camera and the streaming server).",
