    "「不给读」= 这一向的字节数这台没给 —— 不是 0，也不是「没流量」": "\"Not readable\" = this device didn't report bytes for this direction - not 0, and not \"no traffic\"",
    "「两台机器对测」量这两台之间此刻能吃下多少 —— 后端那句下一步（提权那类）才是拿回进程名单的正路。": "\"Two-machine test\" measures how much these two can take right now — the backend's next step (the privilege-elevation kind) is the proper way to get the process list back.",
    "「其余口都还好」这两句都不成立。把限量提到能盖住整张表再问一次。": "neither of the two \"all other ports look fine\" claims holds. Raise the limit until it covers the whole table, then ask again.",
    "「应了 ARP 但没应 ping」的摄像头很常见（不少设备管理页里有一键禁 ping），别当成不在。": "Cameras that answer ARP but not ping are common (many devices have a one-click ping disable in the admin page); don't treat it as absent.",
    "「本机端口与文件共享」看现在是谁在听、谁连着（不量字节），": "the \"Local Ports & File Shares\" page to see who's listening and who's connected (doesn't measure bytes),",
    "「算不准」= 计数器对不上（绕了不止一圈、被重置过，或者两遍用的不是同一档），宁可不给数": "'can't compute' = the counters don't add up (wrapped more than once, was reset, or the two reads used different versions) — better to give no number",
    "「网卡与路由」看有没有开共享/桥接/NAT，「网段上有哪些地址」看是不是有人在往它身上打。": "“Adapters & routes” for whether sharing / bridging / NAT is on, “Addresses on the subnet” for whether somebody is hammering it.",
    "「网页打不开，但 IP ping 得通」就是这一层。": "\"The web page won't open, but the IP pings\" is exactly this layer.",
    "「网页打不开，但 IP ping 得通」就是这一层。换成问网关或一个公共 DNS 再试一次：": "“The web page will not open but the IP pings” is exactly this layer. Try again asking the gateway or a public DNS instead:",
