    "包里的项": "Items in the package",
    "十六进制": "Hex",
    "协商完就没回话（多半这台设备不认 OACK）": "Silent after negotiation (this device most likely does not accept OACK)",
    "协议 / 套件": "Protocol / suite",
    "协议前缀写反了": "Protocol prefix reversed",
    "协议族": "Family",
    "协议规定，是事实": "Required by the protocol; it's a fact",
    "卡在这条连接自己": "Limited by this connection itself",
