    "厂商前缀": "Vendor prefix",
    "厂商发的地址": "Address issued by the vendor",
    "厂商多半是 {0}。{1}": "Vendor is most likely {0}. {1}",
    "原始包落在": "Raw packets saved to",
    "原文": "Original text",
    "原文那一错": "The raw error",
    "去「DHCP 分地址」那一页看有没有应答，再回来看这块口的地址。": "Go to the \"DHCP address assignment\" page to see if there's a reply, then come back to this port's address.",
    "去对一下它的 ONVIF Profile 支持范围（S 只给取流，T 才给云台那一套）。": "Go check its ONVIF Profile support (S gives only stream pull; T adds the PTZ set).",
    "去往 <code>{0}</code> 从 <b>{1}</b> 出去": "To <code>{0}</code> out via <b>{1}</b>",
    "去掉了中间的空格 —— ★ 要是这段是从网址里抄的，那个空格原本可能是个加号": "Inner spaces removed — ★ if this stretch was copied out of a URL, a space there may originally have been a plus sign",
    "去掉了字节之间的分隔符": "Removed the separators between the bytes",
    "去掉了开头的 0x": "Stripped the leading 0x",
    "去掉了成对引号": "Matching quotes stripped",
    "去掉了折行带的换行（命令行输出那种每 76 列一段）": "Stripped the newlines from wrapping (command-line output that wraps every 76 columns)",
    "去掉了首尾空白": "Leading and trailing whitespace removed",
    "去查客户端：编码是 H.265 的话浏览器基本不放（换 H.264 那一路）、": "Check the client: if the codec is H.265 the browser usually won't play it (switch to the H.264 stream),",
    "去查线、查那个 PoE 口给没给功率、查它是不是关着机或被人搬走了。": "Check the cable, check whether that PoE port is delivering power, and check whether it's powered off or someone carried it away.",
    "去查那个服务的日志、数据库和上游，别再翻交换机了。": "Go check that service's logs, database and upstream instead of digging through the switch again.",
    "去核对端口号和平台进程；什么都没回，先回「ping 与端口」那页确认这台在不在、中间隔没隔路由。": "Verify the port number and the streaming-server process; if nothing replies, go back to the \"ping and port\" page to confirm whether this unit is there and whether a router sits in between.",
    "去看平台那个 worker 有没有在跑。": "Go see whether that worker on the streaming server is running.",
    "去看服务起没起、端口号对不对（摄像头 554 是 RTSP，80 是 Web，8000 / 8200 是各家私有 SDK）。": "Check whether the service is up and the port number is right (on cameras, 554 is RTSP, 80 is Web, 8000 / 8200 are the vendors' private SDKs).",
    "去看相机 / OBS / 转推服务那台机器活不活、它的日志里有没有断线重连、它推的是不是这个地址。": "Go check whether the camera / OBS / restreamer machine is alive, whether its log shows disconnect-and-reconnect, and whether it is pushing to this address.",
    "去设备上把主 / 子码流建出来，配好再问一次地址。": "Create the main / sub stream on the device, configure it and then ask for the address again.",
    "去设备上把这个口改成收发（本工具只读，不改配置）。": "Change this port to send-and-receive on the device itself (this tool is read-only and changes no configuration).",
    "去设备后台抄一条填在高级的「网址」里，这一步就接着往下问。": "Copy one from the device's web admin into the \"URL\" field under Advanced, and this step carries on from there.",
    "去问它的服务端口（554 / 80 / 私有 SDK 口）。": "Ask its service port (554 / 80 / private SDK port).",
    "参数、权限或工具内部的错，不能当成「查过了没问题」": "An error in parameters, permission or the tool itself — can't be treated as \"checked, no problem\"",
    "双栈机器上「慢」最省事的解释：每一次新建连接先赌 IPv6，赌输了再走 IPv4，": "The laziest explanation for 'slow' on a dual-stack machine: every new connection bets on IPv6 first, and falls back to IPv4 when it loses,",
