    "发出去就等于把这些给了对方。口令、团体名、令牌、私钥在落盘前已经抹掉、键名留着，": "Sending is exactly handing these to the peer. Passwords, community strings, tokens and private keys are wiped before the file lands on disk; the key names stay, ",
