    "口是 up 的，可这一段在错包/丢包：链路活着但在烂。最常见的是线或模块在坏，": "The port is up, but this stretch shows errored/dropped packets: the link is alive but bad. Most often it's a failing cable or module,",
    "口的 detectionStatus 报 fault / otherFault —— 是这一个口（或它下面那根线、那个设备）的事，": "The port's detectionStatus reports fault / otherFault — this is one port's issue (or the cable or device under it),",
    "口能连上，可它到点不给东西": "The port connects, but it withholds what's due",
    "口起来了、地址也有，可既没人应答也没路过去。查三样：网线/光模块、对端口是不是关着、\n        这个段上是不是根本没有别的设备（VLAN 划错了最常见的就是这个样子）。": "The port is up and there's an address, yet nobody answers and no route gets there. Check three things: the cable / transceiver, whether the far-end port is shut,\n        and whether this segment simply has no other device on it at all (a mis-assigned VLAN looks exactly like this).",
    "口这一栏报 fault / otherFault —— 是那几个口（或它们下面的线、对端设备）的事，不是电源池的事。": "The port column reports fault / otherFault — it's those ports (or the cables or peer devices under them), not the power pool.",
    "另一块网卡上。看下面哪几步压根没问出去 —— 那几步才是这份结论的边界，也是下一步该补的地方。": "on another network adapter. See which steps below weren't asked at all — those are the edge of this conclusion and what to fill in next.",
    "另一头没测到：要么没填那一头的地址，要么填了但它自己没通 —— 值里那一栏是空的还是 failed，一眼看得见。": "The other end wasn't measured: either its address wasn't filled in, or it was filled in but that end isn't up — the value column shows at a glance whether it's empty or failed.",
    "另一档也没答（版本这一条已经排除了）": "The other case didn't answer either (the version possibility is already ruled out)",
    "只丢自己的回应，转发的流量它一个没丢": "Drops only its own replies; forwarded traffic it doesn't lose a single one",
    "只做设备档的就没有媒体服务。★ 这不必去翻密码，要确认的是这台到底支持到哪一档。": "A device-profile-only implementation has no media service. ★ Do not go digging for the password; what needs confirming is how far this device supports ONVIF profiles.",
    "只删本机配置目录里那一个文件，<b>设备上跑过的痕迹和审计日志都不动</b>。": "Deletes only that one file in this machine's config directory; <b>the traces left on the device and the audit log are untouched</b>.",
