    "同一跳出现过不止一个下一跳：负载分担本来就这样，不算故障。★ 只有当每次翻到一条更烂的路时才卡人 —— ": "More than one next hop showed up at the same hop: load sharing looks exactly like this; not a fault. ★ It only bites when every flip lands on a worse path — ",
