    "多为等价路径负载分担（本来就这样），或者是路由在翻动。翻动本身不卡人，「每次换到一条更烂的路」才会 —— 对照下面的丢包和往返看。": "Mostly equal-cost multipath (working as designed), or the route is flapping. Flapping itself doesn't hurt; \"switching to a worse path each time\" does — compare against the loss and round-trip below.",
    "多久回落": "How long before fallback",
    "多半是 RTSP、RTMP 或设备自己的私有协议 —— 取流用「摄像头取流」那一页探。": "Most likely RTSP, RTMP or the device's own private protocol — to pull a stream, probe on the \"Camera stream pull\" page.",
    "多半是中间有人静默丢（防火墙 / ACL / 端口防护），也可能是主机根本不在。": "Most likely someone in the middle silently drops (firewall / ACL / port protection), or the host simply isn't there.",
    "多半是码率突然冲高，或者编码器的 GOP 比切片周期还长 —— 改切片周期或码率上限，不是改网络。": "Most likely a bitrate spike, or the encoder's GOP is longer than the segment duration — change the segment duration or the bitrate cap, not the network.",
    "多半是这个平台这里的读取方式还没实现，或者被系统挡住了。": "Most likely the platform's read method here isn't implemented, or the OS is blocking it.",
    "多半是这台只肯收推流、对播放侧的命令直接丢弃（不少只做单向转推的服务器就这样），": "Most likely this host only accepts ingest and drops player-side commands outright (many one-way relay-only servers behave this way),",
    "多半是这台只肯收推流、对播放侧的命令直接丢弃，或者中间那台设备只放行握手那种小报文。": "Most likely this server only accepts ingest and silently drops play-side commands, or the device in between only lets handshake-size packets through.",
    "多数路由器默认丢掉定向广播，没醒先怀疑这一条。": "Most routers drop directed broadcasts by default; if it did not wake, suspect this first.",
    "多数还带「一键禁 ping」的开关。★ 别再拿 ping 不通当证据了，直接去问它服务的端口。": "Most also carry a one-click \"disable ping\" switch. ★ Stop treating a failed ping as evidence — go straight to the port its service listens on.",
    "多网卡、或者插了 VPN 之后最典型的病：两条一样的路优先级接近，内核在它们之间换 —— ": "The most typical fault with multiple adapters or after connecting a VPN: two identical paths with close priority, and the kernel switches between them — ",
    "大包就是在中间某一环被挡住或被迫分片：隧道、VPN、PPPoE、被人改小过的交换机口。": "Big packets are blocked or forced to fragment somewhere in the middle: tunnels, VPN, PPPoE, a switch port someone shrank.",
    "大包就是在中间某个环节被挡住的：隧道、PPPoE、VPN、或者被人改小过 MTU 的交换机口。": "Large packets are being blocked somewhere in the middle: a tunnel, PPPoE, VPN, or a switch port whose MTU was lowered.",
    "大华是 /cam/realmonitor?channel=1&subtype=0 —— 通道号和主/子码流就差最后那几位。": "Dahua uses /cam/realmonitor?channel=1&subtype=0 — channel and main/sub stream differ only in those last few characters.",
