    "完全没回应": "No reply at all",
    "实际到手的不够，往下就没有可信的边界了 —— 后面全是猜的，所以只能停。": "What actually arrived isn't enough, and past that there is no trustworthy boundary — everything after would be guesswork, so it can only stop.",
