    "对方回了 ICMP 端口不可达：主机是活的，只是这个端口没有服务。要么是服务没起来，要么你打错了端口。": "The peer returned ICMP port unreachable: the host is alive, there's just no service on this port. Either the service isn't up, or you hit the wrong port.",
    "对方明确回了「不给」：RATE 是问得太密被限速，STEP 是它直说你的钟偏得超过它的容错 —— 后者等于替你确认了「时钟确实不对」。看下面每一行的码分别是哪一种。": "The peer explicitly said \"no\": RATE means you asked too fast and got rate-limited, STEP means it told you straight that your clock drift exceeds its tolerance - the latter confirms \"the clock really is wrong\". Check which code each row below is.",
    "对方明确拒绝：这个端口上没有 HTTP 服务（机器本身是活的）。": "The peer explicitly refused: no HTTP service on this port (the machine itself is alive).",
    "对测口正开着：{0}": "Test port is open: {0}",
    "对照一次：同一台拿 rtmp:// 问，RTMP 侧完整而 FLV 侧断 —— 是转封装那一层。": "Do one comparison: ask the same host over rtmp:// — RTMP complete while FLV breaks — that's the remux layer.",
    "对照方法：同一台拿 rtmp:// 那一路再问一次，RTMP 侧有视频而 FLV 侧没有 —— 是分发这一层丢的。": "How to compare: ask the same host again over the rtmp:// path — video on the RTMP side but not on the FLV side — that's delivery dropping it.",
    "对照段": "Control segment",
    "对照段把填的这段整个包住": "The comparison segment completely encloses the one you filled in",
    "对照那一步的丢包和往返看，别看它翻没翻。": "Compare against the loss and round-trip at that step; don't watch whether it flapped.",
    "对着「扫一片端口」那一行看它到底开的是哪个口，再改地址里的端口。": "Read the \"scan a range of ports\" row to see which port it really has open, then change the port in the address.",
    "对端上限": "Peer limit",
    "对端在干重活都会这样。如果整条线都在晃而挑不出单发，那是链路质量本身在晃，不是谁卡了一下。": "That's how it goes whenever the peer is doing heavy work. If the whole line wobbles and no single probe stands out, it's the link quality itself wobbling, not one party stalling.",
    "对端已经写了": "The peer has already written",
