    "对端明确回了 RST —— ★ 主机是「活着」的，只是这个端口没服务。去看服务起没起、端口号对不对。": "The peer answered with a clear RST — ★ the host is alive; this port just has no service. Check whether the service is up and the port number is right.",
    "对端正在抓": "Peer is capturing",
