    "对该通道有取流权限 —— 现场十次有八次是权限而不是密码。": "It has pull permission on that channel — on site, eight times out of ten it is permissions rather than the password.",
    "对象标识符": "Object Identifier",
    "对面主机在，但这个 UDP 口没人接（它回了不可达）。先核对地址与端口抄对没有，": "The peer host is there, but nothing takes this UDP port (it answered unreachable). First check the address and port were copied correctly,",
    "对面没开对测口": "The peer's test port isn't open",
    "对面的口同时跑的路数满了：等几秒再问，或去那台上把没在用的会话停掉。": "The peer port has hit its limit on concurrent sessions: wait a few seconds and ask again, or go to that device and stop the idle sessions.",
    "对面的口满了": "The port on the far side is saturated",
    "对面那台的字节闸开小了。在那台上把「一路最多」放大再打一次，才是这条链路的真数。": "The peer's byte cap is set too small. Raise \"max per stream\" on that machine and run the traffic again — that is the real number for this link.",
