    "帧": "frames",
    "常见于双方的协议版本/加密套件没有交集，或者对端根本不是 TLS 服务。细节看 reason。": "Usually means the two sides have no protocol version / cipher suite in common, or the peer isn't a TLS service at all. See reason for details.",
    "常见于它要求客户端证书，或者双方的协议版本没有交集。细节看原始结果里的 detail。": "Usually it wants a client certificate, or the two sides' protocol versions have no overlap. See detail in the raw result.",
    "常见于设备证书链太长、要现场补中间证书，或者双方的套件要来回试几轮才谈成。": "Common when the device's certificate chain is too long and an intermediate certificate must be added on site, or when the two sides need several rounds to settle on a cipher suite.",
    "常见原因是邻居表里有它，可本机到它的路上没有任何一段被别的工具问到（LLDP 没读、路由不经过它）。": "The usual cause is a neighbor-table entry for it while no stretch of the path from this machine to it was picked up by any other tool (LLDP not read, no route through it).",
    "常见的三种：1935 上跑的其实是 HTTP-FLV、端口号抄错撞上了 Web 管理页、": "Three common cases: what runs on 1935 is actually HTTP-FLV, a mistyped port lands on the web admin page, ",
