    "播放器会反复缓冲、画面越播越往后拖 —— 现场读成「卡」而不是「坏」。": "The player buffers over and over and the picture drifts further behind as it plays — on site that reads as \"stalling\", not \"broken\".",
    "播放器切没切到这一路、平台到客户端那一段（CDN / 反向代理）有没有换地址。": "Whether the player switched to this stream, and whether the segment from the streaming server to the client (CDN / reverse proxy) changed address.",
