    "有块网卡是孤岛": "An adapter is an island",
    "有效期": "Valid until",
    "有标签": "Has tags",
    "有流": "Stream present",
    "有点偏": "Slightly off",
    "有画面": "Has picture",
    "有的服务由 xinetd / launchd 这类父进程拉起，停父的没用，停子的马上又被拉起来。": "Some services are launched by a parent like xinetd / launchd — killing the parent does nothing, and killing the child just gets it relaunched.",
    "有窗在丢包": "Some windows have packet loss",
    "有端口开着": "Some ports are open",
    "有端口明确回了拒绝 —— 拒绝说明对方收到了包并且答了，所以主机在、路也通，只是这些端口上没有服务。": "Some ports answered a clear refusal — a refusal means the peer received the packet and answered it, so the host is there and the path works, there is simply no service on these ports.",
    "有线网口": "Wired port",
    "有设备明确回了「到不了这台」": "A device explicitly answered “this host is unreachable”",
    "有设备还没配好网络": "A device hasn't finished configuring its network",
    "有进程在吃": "A process is eating it",
    "有，但没有可以照摊的项": "There is metadata, but no field that can be laid out",
    "服务器域名解析不出来": "The server's domain won't resolve",
    "服务器拒绝查询": "Server refused the query",
    "服务器明确说没有这个名字。先核对有没有拼错、少带后缀；内网名字要看这台机器有没有走": "The server clearly says there is no such name. First check for a typo or a missing suffix; for internal names, check whether this machine goes through",
    "服务器明确说这个域名没有 —— 先核对是不是拼错了。": "The server clearly says this domain doesn't exist — check for a typo first.",
    "服务器自己查不到": "The server itself cannot be queried",
    "服务器说有这路、play 也答应了，可一个媒体字节都没到": "The server says the stream exists and play agreed too, yet not one media byte arrived",
    "服务器说有这路，可一个媒体字节都没到": "The server says the stream exists, yet not one media byte arrived",
    "服务地址": "Service address",
    "服务是活着的、明确回了话，拒的是这个请求：地址不对、没登录、或者方法不让用。往地址和权限上查，别往网络上查。": "The service is alive and answered explicitly — it rejected this request: wrong address, not logged in, or method not allowed. Chase the address and permissions, not the network.",
    "服务端": "Server side",
    "服务端自己出错了（5xx）": "The server failed on its own (5xx)",
