    "本机喊不出去": "This machine gets no answer out",
    "本机回环": "This machine's loopback",
    "本机在听这些口": "Ports this machine is listening on",
    "本机地址": "This machine's address",
    "本机快": "This Machine Is Fast",
    "本机慢": "This machine is slow",
    "本机或路上某台设备把组播挡了 —— 容器里跑、VPN 只给了一个 /32、系统禁了组播，都会卡在这里。": "This machine or some device on the path is blocking multicast — running in a container, a VPN that gave only a /32, or the OS disabling multicast all get stuck here.",
    "本机按填的那个算的：<code>{0}</code> ★ 两边不是一个": "This machine computed it from what you filled in: <code>{0}</code> ★ the two sides are not the same",
    "本机时钟": "This machine's clock",
    "本机时钟偏得太多": "This machine's clock is off by too much",
    "本机时钟差得足以让别的东西出错": "This machine's clock is off enough to make other things fail",
    "本机没有任何进程在听它，也没有本机发起的连接在用它。★ 这一句只对本机成立 —— ": "No process on this machine is listening on it, and no connection started by this machine is using it. ★ This statement only holds for this machine — ",
    "本机没有去往那个地址的路由": "This machine has no route to that address",
    "本机没有在跑的持续质量监测（而且找不到用户配置目录，账没地方存）。": "No continuous quality monitoring is running here (and no user config directory was found — there is nowhere to keep the journal).",
    "本机没有在跑的持续质量监测，配置目录里也还没有任何留痕 —— 要盯一段时间先开一路（net.quality.watch）。": "No continuous quality monitoring is running here, and the config directory has no trace of one yet — to watch a stretch of time, start one first (net.quality.watch).",
    "本机没路": "No route on this machine",
    "本机现在没在抓，也没有上过一次的账：用 net.capture.start 开一路，或者用 net.capture.open 打开一份别人抓好的文件。": "Nothing is being captured here now, and there is no journal of a previous run: start one with net.capture.start, or open a file someone else captured with net.capture.open.",
    "本机用 <code>{0}</code>": "This machine uses <code>{0}</code>",
    "本机端口与文件共享": "Local ports and file shares",
    "本机端口占用": "Local port in use",
    "本机管理 —— 不是哪家厂商名下的地址（随机地址、虚机网卡、协议组播都在这里）": "Locally administered — not an address under any vendor (random addresses, VM adapters, and protocol multicast all land here)",
    "本机管理位是置着的、组播位是清着的：能当设备源地址，也不在任何厂商名下的地址段里。": "Here the administrative bit is set and the multicast bit is clear: it can serve as a device source address, and it isn't inside any vendor's assigned range.",
    "本机管理位是置着的：iOS / Android 的私有 Wi-Fi 地址、Windows 的随机 MAC、MAC 克隆都在这里。": "The locally administered bit is set: iOS / Android private Wi-Fi addresses, Windows random MACs, and MAC clones all land here.",
    "本机缓存里的旧记录": "Stale records in this machine's cache",
    "本机网卡": "This machine's network adapters",
    "本机网段的定向广播地址": "The directed broadcast address of this machine's subnet",
    "本机认这条链": "This machine trusts this chain",
    "本机这一份": "This machine's copy",
    "本机这一头": "This machine's end",
    "本机这一族没有出路": "This family has no egress on this machine",
    "本机验不过这条链": "This machine cannot verify this chain",
    "本来会发到哪": "Where it would have gone",
    "机器在，那个端口上没服务": "The host is there, no service on that port",
    "来自 <code>{0}</code>（{1}）<br>{2} 帧、{3}{4}": "From <code>{0}</code> ({1})<br>{2} frames, {3}{4}",
    "来路": "Where it came from",
    "来路编号不对、或者这项能力没开。先核「平台侧编号」填的是它配的那个。": "The source number is wrong, or this capability isn't enabled. First check that \"platform-side number\" holds the one it's configured with.",
    "某个服务的守护进程，父进程拉起的停父的没用。想抓「偶尔冒一下」那股，把窗口拉到 10~30 秒再数一次。": "A daemon for some service started by its parent — stopping the parent won't help. To catch a 'pops up now and then' burst, widen the window to 10~30 s and count again.",
    "某跳起变慢": "Slower from one hop on",
    "查 DHCP 有没有发网关，或者静态地址里那个网关填错了。": "Check whether DHCP hands out a gateway, or the gateway in the static address is wrong.",
    "查会话失败：": "Session query failed:",
    "查它上游那条链路、它自己的默认路由和 NAT。": "Check its upstream link, its own default route and NAT.",
    "查它的地址还在不在、中间那台路由有没有到它的路由。": "Check whether its address is still there and whether the router in between has a route to it.",
    "查客户端的解码能力、播放器那边收没收到、或者平台有没有把这路转发出去。": "Check the client's decode capability, whether the player is receiving anything, or whether the streaming server is forwarding this stream.",
    "查线、查 AP、查网关本身；最好另拿一台机器同时发一份对照，才知道是不是只有这台的事。": "Check the cable, the AP, and the gateway itself; best run a simultaneous control from another machine to know whether it's only this one.",
    "查网卡开关、虚拟口 / VPN 的残留、无线关联上了没有。": "Check the adapter's hardware switch, virtual port / VPN leftovers, and whether the wireless is associated.",
    "查那一台和它后面那条链路，别再从两头互相 ping 了。": "Check that device and the link behind it instead of pinging back and forth between the two ends.",
    "查那三样，不是查这根线。": "Check those three, not this cable.",
    "标签一直在来、只有音频那一种。播放器拿到的是「有声音的黑屏」，而多数播放器不报错。": "Tags keep arriving, and only the audio kind. What the player gets is a black screen with sound, and most players don't raise an error.",
    "标签声称的长度与到手的对不上": "The length a tag claims doesn't match what was received",
    "标签数到了上限": "Tag count hit its limit",
    "核对推流地址与播放地址上的流名：各家服务器带参数（?live=1、?key=）时那一段也算名字的一部分，": "Check the stream name in the ingest address and the playback address: on some servers the query part (?live=1, ?key=) also counts as part of the name,",
    "核对流名：各家把参数算在名字里（?live=1、?key=xxx），少一段就是另一个流；": "Check the stream name: each vendor folds parameters into the name (?live=1, ?key=xxx), and one segment short is a different stream;",
    "检测状态卡在 searching：没插东西、插上来的东西签名不合规、或者它要的电超了这台给的档。": "The detect state is stuck at searching: nothing is plugged in, what's plugged in isn't signature-compliant, or it draws more than this unit's power class allows.",
    "模块没插、或者这台不支持这个口 —— 不是故障。换一个在位的口再看。": "No module inserted, or this device doesn't support this port — not a fault. Try another port with a module in place.",
    "模式": "Mode",
    "正在 {0} 上跑「{1}」…（{2} 条会改东西，批准框上会一条条念给你看）": "Running \"{1}\" on {0}... ({2} will change things; the approval box lists them one by one)",
    "正在共享": "Sharing",
    "正在启动…启动前会自动探一遍，确认没有别的 DHCP 在发地址。": "Starting… before it starts it probes once to confirm no other DHCP is handing out addresses.",
    "正在广播探测…（约 3 秒）": "Broadcasting probes… (about 3 s)",
