    "段算得出来（见下），但登记时别把这个地址抄成网段地址。": "The segment does compute (see below), but when you write it down do not copy this address as the subnet address.",
    "每一发都拿到了「到不了」的回执 —— 包出得去、也有人回话，中间的路是通的，": "Every probe got a \"cannot reach\" receipt — packets get out and someone replies, so the path in between works,",
    "每一族的追踪都到了终点。慢不慢看下面逐跳的往返 —— 某一跳突然变大，就是那里。到了终点还上不了服务，那是端口或服务的事，去「网站与证书」那一页问它回什么。": "Every family's trace reached the destination. Whether it's slow — read the per-hop round-trips below — a hop that suddenly balloons is the culprit. If it reaches the destination but still can't get the service, that's a port or service matter; go to the \"Web & Certificate\" page to see what it replies.",
    "每一跳的丢包和往返都在正常范围里。要是还是觉得卡，那多半不是这条路径的事 —— 换「网页 / 接口探测」看服务自己慢不慢。": "Every hop's packet loss and round-trip time are inside the normal range. If it still feels slow, it is mostly not this path — switch to “Web page / API probe” and see whether the service itself is slow.",
