    "清单写着「一片最多 N 秒」，实测那片比这还长。★ 起播没问题，": "The playlist says \"each segment at most N seconds\", yet the measured segment is even longer. ★ Playback starts fine,",
    "清单在下面，每台都写着凭什么判定它在线。★ 收到自己的 ping 应答最硬，": "The list is below, and each device shows what it was judged online by. ★ Getting your own ping reply is the hardest evidence,",
    "清单地址常常带着有时效的签名参数（token 过期就是这一档）：地址要从页面上现抄，": "Manifest addresses often carry time-limited signed parameters (an expired token is this case): copy the address fresh from the page,",
    "清单是 B 节点写的）。先在平台上换一路地址再问一次，只有一路这样就是这一路的配置。": "the manifest was written by node B). First switch to another stream address on the server and ask again; if only one behaves this way, it's that stream's configuration.",
