    "状态码是 2xx。慢不慢看下面那行分段耗时 —— 卡在网络还是卡在服务端，处理的人完全不同。": "The status code is 2xx. Whether it is slow is in the stage-times line below — stuck in the network and stuck at the server are completely different people to call.",
    "状态码是 Play.Start，唯独码流没过来。十有八九是推流端与服务器之间的中间那道 NAT / 防火墙": "The status is Play.Start, yet only the media stream isn't coming through. Nine times out of ten it's the NAT / firewall in between the ingest source and the server",
    "状态问不出来": "Status cannot be asked",
    "猜对九次、错一次，人就顺着错的那一次去机房。": "Guess right nine times and wrong once, and the person walks to the equipment room following the wrong one.",
    "现在换是顺手的事，等到现场发现打不开就是加班的事。": "Rotating it now is a quick job; discovering on site that it will not open is an overtime job.",
    "现在没开。开一次就是一次对外暴露（多一个写路径、多一条能驱动别的机器的通道），": "Not open now. Opening once is one external exposure (one more write path, one more channel that can drive other machines),",
    "现在没开着。对面连过来会得到「明确拒绝」。要量就先开一下，用完停掉 —— ": "It is not open now. A connection from the peer gets a flat refusal. To measure, open it briefly and stop it when you are done — ",
    "现在没开着。开一次就是一次对外暴露，需要时再开、用完就停 —— ": "Not open now. Opening once is one external exposure; open it when needed, stop it when done — ",
    "现在没有手机在投。<br>手机上开「投屏」后，画面会出现在这里。": "No phone is casting right now.<br>Once you turn on screen casting on the phone, the picture will appear here.",
    "现场看到的「网有问题」，根在这里。先校时，再回头看别的。": "The \"network problem\" you see on site has its root here. Fix the clock first, then revisit everything else.",
    "生效时间": "Effective time",
    "用什么测的": "Measured with",
    "用户看到的就是「转很久」。先把这一段修干净，再看那些分段耗时还剩多少。": "What the user sees is a long spinner. Fix this stretch cleanly first, then see how much of the per-segment timing is left.",
    "用时": "Elapsed",
    "用的是匿名加密套件（没有身份可验证），或者它不是按 HTTPS 出证的。": "An anonymous cipher suite is used (no identity to verify), or it doesn't serve a cert over HTTPS.",
    "用管理员权限再导一次才补得齐；只想补那几项，就在高级里单独勾它们。": "Import again with admin rights to complete them; if you only want those items, tick them individually under Advanced.",
    "用管理员权限再问一次才算数；看不见的那些里才可能藏着主角。": "Ask again with administrator privileges for it to count; the main player may be hidden among the invisible ones.",
    "用过，没写进结果和日志": "Used, but not written into the result or the log",
    "由 DHCP 下发": "Handed out by DHCP",
    "电源池和口的状态都读回来了。★ 整张表里有口「在检测」不是故障清单：没插受电设备的空口本来就该在检测。": "The power pool and port states were all read back. ★ Ports showing \"detecting\" somewhere in the table aren't a fault list: an empty port with no powered device attached should be detecting.",
    "电源池自己报了 faulty —— 这是电源模块、整机供电的事，不是哪一根线、也不是哪个口的配置。": "The power supply pool itself reports faulty — this is the power module and whole-chassis power, not any one cable or any port's configuration.",
    "界面语言": "Interface language",
