    "留的片数比清单承诺的少，或者分片落在多台节点上而存储没共享（问到 A 节点、": "Fewer segments are kept than the playlist promises, or segments land on multiple nodes without shared storage (queried node A,",
    "症状是「几台机器同时时通时不通」，比配不上难查得多。确认要再用。": "The symptom is “several machines come and go at the same time”, far harder to chase than one that will not configure. Be sure before you reuse it.",
