    "目标端口没答，但同一台机器的对照端口出声了 —— 至少能排除「整机不对」。剩下的两种还得往下分：": "The target port didn't answer, but the control port on the same machine did — \"the whole machine is down\" is at least ruled out. The remaining two causes still need separating:",
