    "端口开着但它不答你这一句（换成协议里真实的一条报文再问一次），或者这个端口被单独拦了。": "The port is open but it won't answer your query (ask again with a real message from the protocol), or this port is blocked on its own.",
    "端口开着却不回 RTSP，大概率端口号填错了：554 才是 RTSP，80 是 Web，8000 / 8200 是各家私有 SDK 的口子。也可能是设备只放行了指定 IP。": "The port is open but does not answer RTSP; most likely the port number is wrong: 554 is RTSP, 80 is Web, 8000 / 8200 are the vendors' private SDK ports. It may also be that the device only allows specified IPs.",
    "端口开着，可它不回 ONVIF 这一问": "The port is open, but it won't answer this ONVIF request",
