    "结果里「内容看着像」那一格写了头几个字节认出的形状。RTSP、RTMP 那两路用上面几张卡去问。": "The \"content looks like\" cell in the result names the shape recognized from the first bytes. For RTSP and RTMP, use the cards above.",
    "结果里「它说的那句」会指出是哪种，照那个位置补，别改地址前缀。": "The \"what it said\" in the result points to which one; fill in at that spot, don't change the address prefix.",
