    "网络往返本身就慢或第一跳 SYN 被丢了一次 —— 查路由距离、对端 backlog，": "The network round trip itself is slow, or the first SYN to hop 1 was dropped once — check route distance and the peer's backlog,",
    "网络这一趟是通的（它回话了），问题在它后面：程序异常、上游服务坏了、或者超出负载。": "The network path is fine (it replied); the problem is behind it: a program exception, a broken upstream service, or overload.",
    "网络配置已经不用查了，去查线、查供电（PoE 那个口给没给功率）、查它是不是关着机。": "Network config is no longer worth checking — check the cable, the power (whether the PoE port delivers any), and whether it's powered off.",
