    "老 Windows 与打印机。★ 只有这一路给得出 MAC，它要点名问": "Old Windows machines and printers. ★ Only this route can yield the MAC, and it must ask by name",
    "老过化的口": "Aged-out ports",
    "而 ping 和体检看着都正常。要么修上游的 IPv6，要么先把这块口的 IPv6 关掉。": "and both ping and the check look normal. Either fix upstream IPv6, or turn off IPv6 on this port for now.",
    "而体检那一圈里有几项是不走代理的。查代理地址、端口，或者先把系统代理关掉再试。": "and a few checks in that health-check round bypass the proxy. Check the proxy address and port, or turn the system proxy off first and retry.",
    "而它们走的路不一样。★ 实际走哪条由应用挑哪个地址决定，不由本机决定 —— ": "and they take different paths. ★ Which one is actually taken is decided by which address the application picks, not by this machine — ",
    "而是中间有东西只放行 TCP 三次握手、往下看都不看就丢，或者这台只对外地那几台地址答话。": "but that something in between lets only the TCP three-way handshake through and drops the rest without looking, or this device answers only those few off-site addresses.",
    "能不能翻目录": "Whether the directory can be browsed",
