    "表读全了，里面确实没有它。★ 这不等于「它不在这台设备上」：这张表只记最近发过帧的源地址，": "The table was read in full and it really is not in there. ★ That is not the same as \"it is not behind this device\": the table only keeps source addresses that sent a frame recently,",
    "表读回来了。★ 这不等于「这些口都还好」：整张表里有口 down 是正常现象（没插线的空口本来就该 down），": "The table is back. ★ That is not the same as \"all these ports are fine\": ports down in a full table is normal (an empty socket with no cable should be down),",
