    "被滚掉多少窗": "Windows rolled off",
    "要么两台机器抢同一个地址，要么这台改了地址而邻居表里还留着旧的在答话。\n        先对一下 MAC：邻居表里这个 IP 挂的 MAC 换了没有，再看是哪台在发免费 ARP。": "Either two machines are fighting over the same address, or this one changed its address while the old one is still answering from the neighbor table.\n        Compare MACs first: has the MAC hanging off this IP in the neighbor table changed, then find which machine is sending the gratuitous ARP.",
    "要么修上游的 IPv6，要么先把这台机器的 IPv6 关掉。": "Either fix IPv6 upstream, or switch IPv6 off on this machine for now.",
    "要么全被禁用，要么没有一块拿到可用地址 —— 后面每一步都是在它之上测的，先解决这一步。": "Either all are disabled, or no adapter got a usable address — every later step is measured on top of it, so fix this one first.",
    "要么它压根不理这一句。★ 还有一种：它从**另一个端口**回话，这一问的套接字只收对端那一对地址，": "or it ignores this entirely. ★ Another case: it replies from **another port**, and this request's socket only accepts the peer's address pair,",
    "要么把「目标」填成它的 IP（跳过解析）再跑一次，要么换一台同网段的机器同时测。": "Either put its IP in Target (skipping resolution) and run again, or test simultaneously from another machine on the same subnet.",
    "要么改用证书上写着的名字访问，要么按现在这个地址重签一张。": "Either use one of the names written in the certificate, or reissue one for the address you use now.",
    "要么改用证书上写着的名字访问，要么按现在这个地址重签一张。浏览器报 ERR_CERT_COMMON_NAME_INVALID 就是这一条。": "Either access it by the name written on the certificate, or reissue one for the address you use now. A browser reporting ERR_CERT_COMMON_NAME_INVALID is exactly this.",
    "要么是它要求先注册才答。下一步走「本机注册一趟」。": "Or it requires registering first before it answers. The next step is to run \"Register this machine once\".",
    "要么签它的那台机器钟超前，把生效时间签到了未来。去签发的那一头对时刻。": "or the machine that signed it has a clock ahead, signing the not-valid-before into the future. Set the time right at the issuing end.",
    "要判断某一个口，把名字或编号填进去点名再问一次，那一次的判定才说得出「断了还是被关着」。": "To judge one specific port, enter its name or number to single it out and ask again; only that run's verdict can say whether it's down or switched off.",
    "要判断某一个口，把组号口号（或 ifIndex）填进去点名再问一次。": "To judge one specific port, fill in group and port number (or ifIndex) to ask it by name, then query again.",
    "要卡": "Stalls",
    "要在<strong>另一台</strong>上开对测口再来问一次。": "Open a test port on <strong>another machine</strong> and ask again.",
    "要恢复得在设备上开回来（本工具只读，一行配置都不改）。": "Restoring it means enabling it back on the device (this tool is read-only and changes not a single line of configuration).",
    "要是服务起不来并报「地址已在使用」，多半是另一个用户或容器命名空间占的口，那要用管理员权限再问一次。": "If the service will not start and reports \"address already in use\", it is most likely a port held by another user or a container namespace, and that needs an elevated run to see.",
    "要权限": "Needs privilege",
    "要查请先用系统自带的工具看着（活动监视器 / 资源监视器 / <code>cat /proc/net/dev</code>）。": "To check, first use the system's own tools (Activity Monitor / Resource Monitor / <code>cat /proc/net/dev</code>).",
