    "要求认证却没给 WWW-Authenticate，本机算不出该签什么，只能干等。": "It demands authentication but sent no WWW-Authenticate, so this machine cannot work out what to sign and can only wait.",
    "要用的那块网卡连自己的 IPv6 链路本地地址都没有 —— 这个地址是自动生成的，": "The adapter you need does not even have its own IPv6 link-local address — that address is generated automatically,",
