    "要腾这个口就得停掉列出来的那个进程。★ 停之前先确认它是不是你要起的那个服务的守护进程 —— ": "To free this port you have to stop the process listed. ★ Before stopping it, check whether it is the daemon of the very service you want to start —  ",
