    "这个路径上没有这路清单": "This path does not serve this playlist",
    "这个路径没有流": "No stream on this path",
    "这个量级上证书会被判「已过期」或「还没生效」、租约会算成早到期、日志时间戳排不进正确顺序 —— ": "At this magnitude certificates get judged \"expired\" or \"not yet valid\", leases compute as expiring early, and log timestamps won't sort into the right order — ",
    "这个量级上，证书会被判「还没生效」或「已过期」、租约会被算成早到期、日志时间戳排不进正确的顺序 —— 现场看到的「网有问题」，根在这里。至于是不是本机不对，看下面那行：多个源互相印证过才敢指认。": "At this magnitude a certificate is judged \"not valid yet\" or \"expired\", a lease is computed as expiring early, and log timestamps will not sort into the right order — the \"network problem\" you see on site has its root here. Whether it is this machine that is wrong is in the line below: it only accuses once several time sources corroborate each other.",
    "这个问法本身不成立 —— v4 段和 v6 段谈不上撞。要说「这台机器两族是不是都通」，去「域名与时间」那一页做双栈体检。": "This question doesn't hold - a v4 range and a v6 range can't collide. To ask \"is this machine reachable on both families,\" run the dual-stack checkup on the Domain & Time page.",
    "这中间一共被取走 {0} 次、{1}。": "In all it was pulled {0} times in between, {1}.",
    "这些地址上有东西在答话，可它没说过自己是谁 —— 这<b>不等于没有设备</b>，": "Something on these addresses answers, but it never said who it is — this <b>does not mean there is no device</b>, ",
    "这些窗里没毛病": "Nothing wrong in these windows",
    "这份只覆盖停之前那一段，<b>不能</b>当成整个网段的答案：": "This covers only the span before it stopped, and <b>can't</b> be taken as the answer for the whole subnet:",
