    "这条几乎从来不是证书的错，是这台设备的时钟不对（掉电后重置回几年前那种）。先校时，再回来看证书。": "This is almost never the certificate's fault, it is this device's clock being wrong (the kind that resets back to a few years ago after a power loss). Set the time first, then come back to the certificate.",
