    "连得上、也回了话，可回的不是 ONVIF 应答。★ 先照上面那一步自己那句话办：它要是说「那个端口说的是 HTTPS」，": "It connects and answers, but the answer is not an ONVIF reply. ★ First do what that step above says in its own words: if it says \"that port speaks HTTPS\",",
    "连得上但有几发没通：去看出口设备和链路（拔一下网线、换一个口），": "It connects but a few probes did not get through: look at the egress device and the link (reseat the cable, change the port),",
